# Baron Bertram Graywater: "Whenever one or more tokens you control enter, create a 1/1 black Vampire Rogue creature
# token with lifelink. This ability triggers only once each turn." In turn 3 Lingering Souls puts two Spirits onto the
# battlefield together: one trigger (CR 603.2c), one Vampire Rogue. That Rogue is itself a token entering, and flashing
# Souls back puts two more Spirits in, but the ability has already triggered this turn (it triggers only once each turn): no more Rogues. In
# turn 5 Dragon Fodder's Goblins trigger it again, one more Rogue; the turn-3 Rogue attacks and its lifelink gains
# Bot1 1.
